  era: "1773 \xB7 Section 27 \xB7 Constitutional Development \xB7 1773 \u2013 1949"
  title: Regulating Act, 1773
  text: The Regulating Act of 1773 was Parliament's first step to control the Company. It made the Governor of Bengal the Governor-General, the first being Warren Hastings, with a council, and set up a Supreme Court at Calcutta.
